{"ok":true,"module":"io/output/d11","docs":{"io/output/d11/binding_port":{"type":"UInt16","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.binding_port.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.binding_port.help","enum_set":"flowio_binding_port_digital_output","label":"Port physique D11","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.binding_port.label","help":"Identifiant du port physique piloté par la sortie D11. Utiliser \"Non connecté\" pour laisser cette sortie logique non affectée.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.binding_port.help"},"io/output/d11/d11_active_high":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_active_high.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_active_high.help","label":"Actif à 1 D11","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_active_high.label","help":"Si vrai, D11 est active à l'état haut; sinon active-bas.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_active_high.help"},"io/output/d11/d11_initial_on":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_initial_on.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_initial_on.help","label":"État initial ON D11","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_initial_on.label","help":"État appliqué au démarrage pour la sortie D11.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_initial_on.help"},"io/output/d11/d11_momentary":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_momentary.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_momentary.help","label":"Mode impulsion D11","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_momentary.label","help":"Active un fonctionnement impulsionnel pour D11.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_momentary.help"},"io/output/d11/d11_name":{"type":"CharArray","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_name.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_name.help","label":"Nom sortie D11","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_name.label","help":"Nom lisible de la sortie digitale D11.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_name.help"},"io/output/d11/d11_pulse_ms":{"type":"Int32","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_pulse_ms.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_pulse_ms.help","unit":"ms","label":"Durée impulsion D11 (ms)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_pulse_ms.label","help":"Durée de l'impulsion automatique de D11.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.d11_pulse_ms.help"},"io/output/d11/retain_on_warm_reboot":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.retain_on_warm_reboot.help","enum_set":"io_output_boot_behavior","label":"Comportement au reboot D11","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help":"Choisit si D11 applique son état initial au démarrage ou tente de conserver le latch matériel lors d'un reboot chaud. Sur MCP23017, la conservation est ignorée et l'état initial est appliqué.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d11.retain_on_warm_reboot.help"}},"meta":{}}